# No Run / Reload Unless Asked

Do not run, launch, hot reload, or hot restart the application unless the user explicitly asks.

## Rules

- Do not run `flutter run`, `dart run`, or equivalent app launch commands by default
- Do not call hot reload, hot restart, or similar Dart/Flutter MCP tools by default
- Do not restart an already running app after code changes unless asked
- Only run or reload when the user explicitly requests it (e.g. "run the app", "hot reload", "restart")

```text
❌ BAD — after editing UI code, automatically hot reload or flutter run

✅ GOOD — finish the code change and wait; run/reload only if the user asks
```
